{
  "file": "Recommendations",
  "page": 43,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.023799896240234,
        42.10532760620117,
        202.6917724609375,
        51.10532760620117
      ],
      "text": "6.2.3 Adaptation of recommendations",
      "font": "TheSansSemiBold-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.023799896240234,
        54.273040771484375,
        408.1703186035156,
        63.273040771484375
      ],
      "text": "These recommendations must be adapted to the local epidemiological context and",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.005802154541016,
        66.27005004882812,
        408.2154846191406,
        75.27005004882812
      ],
      "text": "programme. National and local programmes should determine the potential value and",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.05080032348633,
        78.26705932617188,
        408.1800231933594,
        87.26705932617188
      ],
      "text": "feasibility of contact investigation in their setting, the extent to which it should be undertaken",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.005802154541016,
        90.26406860351562,
        408.1796875,
        99.26406860351562
      ],
      "text": "and its scope. The approaches will depend on programme factors such as the availability of",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.01480484008789,
        102.26107788085938,
        408.21551513671875,
        111.27908325195312
      ],
      "text": "staff and resources, and the deﬁnitions depend on the diagnostic methods used and the",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.05081558227539,
        114.27609252929688,
        408.3593444824219,
        123.27609252929688
      ],
      "text": "customs and living conditions of the population. Pilot studies should be conducted before",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.18581771850586,
        126.27005004882812,
        408.3873596191406,
        135.27310180664062
      ],
      "text": "implementation to guide the design of local guidelines, determine the diagnostic yield in the",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.22239303588867,
        138.26705932617188,
        385.9141845703125,
        147.26705932617188
      ],
      "text": "setting and determine the factors that inﬂuence the feasibility of full implementation.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.23139572143555,
        168.09336853027344,
        273.12640380859375,
        177.09336853027344
      ],
      "text": "6.2.4 Timing of interviews and identiﬁcation of contacts",
      "font": "TheSansSemiBold-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.24039840698242,
        180.26107788085938,
        407.9820861816406,
        189.27908325195312
      ],
      "text": "If contact investigation is to be initiated, the index case should be interviewed as soon as",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        50.80839920043945,
        192.27304077148438,
        407.9884338378906,
        201.27609252929688
      ],
      "text": "possible after diagnosis (generally within 1 week) to elicit the names of household and close",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        50.8234977722168,
        204.27005004882812,
        408.02435302734375,
        213.27005004882812
      ],
      "text": "contacts. The focus should be on household members, but people in the workplace and other",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        50.859500885009766,
        216.26705932617188,
        408.0964050292969,
        225.26705932617188
      ],
      "text": "settings in which there is exposure should not be ignored. Moreover, contacts in residential",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        50.93149948120117,
        228.26406860351562,
        408.5820617675781,
        237.2730712890625
      ],
      "text": "care facilities, long-term care facilities, gaols and prisons and acute medical care facilities,",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        50.976497650146484,
        240.27008056640625,
        408.111083984375,
        249.27294921875
      ],
      "text": "especially when exposure is by coughing, should be evaluated. Ideally, the interview should",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        50.94621658325195,
        252.26995849609375,
        408.05694580078125,
        261.26995849609375
      ],
      "text": "be conducted by a person who speaks the same language as the index patient and is familiar",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        50.892215728759766,
        264.2669677734375,
        408.05718994140625,
        273.2669677734375
      ],
      "text": "with his or her social and cultural context. Investigations should be conducted for patients",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        50.88321304321289,
        276.26397705078125,
        319.35321044921875,
        285.26397705078125
      ],
      "text": "who have died, if information can be gathered from family members.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        50.892215728759766,
        294.26397705078125,
        408.0797119140625,
        303.2757568359375
      ],
      "text": "A sense of urgency should be conveyed in contact investigations, including prompt",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.041194915771484,
        306.27276611328125,
        408.1789855957031,
        315.27276611328125
      ],
      "text": "interviewing of the index case. Occasionally, a second interview is useful to elicit additional",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.01419448852539,
        318.269775390625,
        408.1880187988281,
        327.269775390625
      ],
      "text": "contacts. Information from the interview should be recorded on standardized forms (see",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.023197174072266,
        330.26678466796875,
        86.7261962890625,
        339.26678466796875
      ],
      "text": "Annex 3).",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.023197174072266,
        360.09307861328125,
        186.99514770507812,
        369.09307861328125
      ],
      "text": "6.2.5 Conducting the investigation",
      "font": "TheSansSemiBold-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.03219985961914,
        372.26080322265625,
        408.1968688964844,
        381.26080322265625
      ],
      "text": "If the human resources are available, the person conducting the contact investigation should",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.03219985961914,
        384.2578125,
        408.2209167480469,
        393.27606201171875
      ],
      "text": "visit the home of the index patient to conduct interviews and ensure referral of all household",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.05610275268555,
        396.2730712890625,
        408.2208557128906,
        405.2730712890625
      ],
      "text": "contacts for evaluation. A home visit will underscore the importance of identifying and",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.05610275268555,
        408.27008056640625,
        408.6619567871094,
        417.27008056640625
      ],
      "text": "evaluating contacts and can ensure a more accurate view of the circumstances of exposure.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.11910629272461,
        420.26708984375,
        408.3470458984375,
        429.26708984375
      ],
      "text": "The home visitor can make an environmental assessment of the residence and provide family",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.16410446166992,
        432.26409912109375,
        408.1943054199219,
        441.2731018066406
      ],
      "text": "counselling and education on the symptoms that should prompt contacts to seek medical",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.029109954833984,
        444.2701110839844,
        408.1990966796875,
        453.2729187011719
      ],
      "text": "attention. This is especially true for children and people with HIV infection, in whom TB can",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.02529525756836,
        456.2699279785156,
        408.24407958984375,
        465.2699279785156
      ],
      "text": "progress rapidly. Home visits may also provide an opportunity for identifying a need for social",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.07929611206055,
        468.2669372558594,
        301.8642578125,
        477.2669372558594
      ],
      "text": "support and for education on TB and infection control measures.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.08829879760742,
        498.09320068359375,
        181.24627685546875,
        507.09320068359375
      ],
      "text": "6.2.6 Monitoring and evaluation",
      "font": "TheSansSemiBold-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.08829879760742,
        510.2608947753906,
        408.2049865722656,
        519.2789306640625
      ],
      "text": "Data from the contact investigation should be collected in a standardized format; examples",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.031002044677734,
        522.2730712890625,
        408.2496643066406,
        531.2730712890625
      ],
      "text": "of forms that may be used are given in Annex 3. TB control programmes should routinely",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.07600021362305,
        534.2700805664062,
        408.2766418457031,
        543.2700805664062
      ],
      "text": "evaluate the effectiveness of contact investigations and design interventions to improve",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.112003326416016,
        546.2670288085938,
        410.28375244140625,
        555.2670288085938
      ],
      "text": "performance. The yield of contact investigations and the incidence of active TB and LTBI",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.15700149536133,
        558.2640380859375,
        408.2857666015625,
        567.2640380859375
      ],
      "text": "should be evaluated to determine whether the intervention is giving the desired results. At a",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.12099838256836,
        570.2610473632812,
        408.2127990722656,
        579.279052734375
      ],
      "text": "minimum, the following information should be collected: number of contact investigations",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.03908920288086,
        580.1522216796875,
        408.3116760253906,
        591.2716064453125
      ],
      "text": "< carried out; number, age (especially children   5 years of age), sex and HIV status of the contacts",
      "font": "LucidaGrande",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.1380729675293,
        594.2686157226562,
        408.43804931640625,
        603.2686157226562
      ],
      "text": "identiﬁed; the number who completed medical evaluation and relevant investigations; the",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.273075103759766,
        604.146240234375,
        408.60040283203125,
        615.2655639648438
      ],
      "text": "< number with active TB; and the numbers of children   5 years of age and PLHIV given isoniazid",
      "font": "LucidaGrande",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.435054779052734,
        618.2625732421875,
        408.5821533203125,
        627.2716064453125
      ],
      "text": "preventive treatment. Data collection during contact investigations has multiple purposes.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        226.3031005859375,
        651.97265625,
        232.91810607910156,
        659.47265625
      ],
      "text": "41",
      "font": "TheSansSemiBold-Plain",
      "size": 7.5,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}